  "body": "we use a key-value(tuple) pair which the name end with `[]` to represent a list type in many implementations. \r\nbut the `encodeURIComponent` would decode `[]`to`%5B`and`%5D` just like rfc3986 says.\r\nSo I don't know whether it should be standardized or it just depend on server side implementation.",
